  "note": "Influx's asteroid/debris mining: tiered miner blocks (1 to 5) draw power and return ore-like conglomerate, processed in crystallizer, infuser, liquifier and transmogrifier into azurum, galibium, palestium and thelxium (new metals, not vanilla). The ores are world ores (needs:ore) but the miner is the intended source. Generator blocks make FE to run the miner (the power lesson). Built-in support: none found in source (no other pack mod references it). Power source still to be chosen."
